{% liquid
  assign normalized_title = product_resource.title | downcase
%}

{% if normalized_title contains 'berber' %}
  <div class="ryztor-media-description">
    <h2>Description</h2>

    <p>
      Berberine capsules offer a convenient way to support your everyday well-being with just two capsules a day.
      This formula is designed to help maintain normal blood sugar levels, promote cardiovascular wellness, and
      support healthy weight management.*
    </p>

    <p>
      Each serving contains Granular Berberine Hydrochloride Extract, a plant-derived compound commonly used to
      support normal metabolic function and balance within the body.*
    </p>

    <p>
      Berberine is also recognized for its role in heart-conscious wellness. By supporting normal cholesterol
      levels and healthy heart function, it can complement a balanced daily lifestyle.*
    </p>

    <p>
      For people focused on weight management, Berberine supports the body's normal metabolism and can help you
      stay consistent with a broader wellness routine.*
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Supports normal blood sugar levels*</li>
      <li>Supports cardiovascular and heart wellness*</li>
      <li>Supports healthy metabolism and weight management*</li>
      <li>Two capsules daily · 60 capsules per bottle</li>
      <li>Gluten-free, non-GMO, vegetarian, and vegan friendly</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Supplements work best alongside balanced nutrition, regular exercise, hydration, and quality sleep.
      Individual experiences may vary.
    </p>
  </div>
{% endif %}

{% stylesheet %}
  .product-information__media:has(.ryztor-media-description) media-gallery.sticky-content {
    position: static;
    top: auto;
    z-index: auto;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .ryztor-media-description {
    margin-top: 34px;
    color: rgb(23 21 30 / 76%);
    font-size: .88rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .ryztor-media-description h2 {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: #17151e;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -.015em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ryztor-media-description p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .ryztor-media-description ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 4px 0 18px;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .ryztor-media-description li {
    padding-left: 2px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ryztor-media-description {
      margin: 28px 16px 0;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
